            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9160, Clark Solid Brass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design with an easy installation, the Clark Cabinet Knob will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The Clark Solid Brass Cabinet Knob is available in 1 inch, 1-1/4 inch, and 1-9/16 inch diameters. Choose from either polished brass or polished chrome finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Clark Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9160/26</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 25/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9160/32</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-29/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9160/40</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
